Package: graphlib
Architecture: amd64
Priority: optional
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Offline GraphRAG document library agent (vector search + knowledge graph)
 graphlib is a fully offline GraphRAG system: it combines vector search
 over embeddings with knowledge-graph structures (entities and
 relationships) to provide deep, context-aware answers from local
 document collections without any network access.
